      "A song cycle with interludes of prose (Op. 31, 1973), to lyrics by Hadjidakis himself and Manos Eleftheriou. Three figures — a wayfarer, a drunken girl, Alcibiades — and between them “Ta spasmena podilata”, “To ainigma”, “O trelos kosmos”. Cover by Giorgos Stathopoulos."
